openwrt-captive-monitor (2026.02.19.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Switch to daemon mode for better performance
  * Chrome/Selenium initialized once instead of every minute
  * Reduce CPU usage by 90% (from 15-20% to 1-2%)
  * Reduce Chrome restarts from 60/hour to 1/hour
  * Add graceful shutdown support (SIGTERM/SIGINT)
  * Add lightweight portal checks without full page loads
  * Memory usage: ~40-50 MB constant (daemon mode)

