openwrt-captive-monitor (2025.12.11.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package release
  * Migrate from OpenWrt shell script to Python/Selenium solution
  * Add systemd service for automatic portal detection
  * Support for Debian/Ubuntu on Raspberry Pi and x86-64 systems
  * Requires 4GB+ RAM for Chrome/Selenium operation

